Text=Yes, Cortes approached me about this a few months ago. It just so happens that I finished the design for a mechanical arm and I gave it to Eduardo the Blacksmith. However, he will need a supply of Red Iron in order to complete it. Bring the Red Iron to the blacksmith and he will make the arm for Cortes. Anything else?
